# Tribunal "A Temple Informant": Tienius Delitian wants an informant inside the
# Temple ("Temple informant", "I'll take care of it." 1: 1). Galsa Andrano in
# the Temple Infirmary, at disposition 90, says what the priests think of
# Helseth ("discontent in the Temple", "Ask about the Temple and King Helseth"
# 1: 50), and Tienius takes the report (100).
# Bribes, repeated until they land, raise Galsa. Ref FormIDs carry
# Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr05_people --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr06_temple
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask Temple informant
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR06_Temple == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell 4119 4220 14866 0 "Mournhold Temple: Infirmary"
until 600 "Galsa Andrano"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Galsa Andrano
persuade bribe100 until "Galsa Andrano"->GetDisposition >= 90
ask discontent in the Temple
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex TR06_Temple == 50
bye
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
ask Temple informant
expect GetJournalIndex TR06_Temple == 100
bye
end
